[
  {
    "id": "bh1750-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "BH1750 light meter",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Measures the illuminance with a BH1750 every 2 s and formats it as \"350 lx\". Each message triggers one one-time measurement; change the mode (H 1 lx, H2 0.5 lx, L 4 lx) or the measurement time register in the BH1750 device node to trade resolution, range and measurement time."
  },
  {
